WEBVTT

00:16:28.880 --> 00:16:32.896
If we're not going to fast-twitch
from browser window to browser window,

00:16:32.920 --> 00:16:34.536
we have to live like a hermit,

00:16:34.560 --> 00:16:37.880
focus on one thing
to the exclusion of everything else.

00:16:38.680 --> 00:16:41.056
I think that's a false dilemma.

00:16:41.080 --> 00:16:43.736
We can make multitasking work for us,

00:16:43.760 --> 00:16:46.320
unleashing our natural creativity.

00:16:47.440 --> 00:16:48.920
We just need to slow it down.

00:16:50.200 --> 00:16:51.440
So ...

00:16:52.880 --> 00:16:55.376
Make a list of your projects.

00:16:55.400 --> 00:16:56.800
Put down your phone.

00:16:57.640 --> 00:16:59.680
Pick up a couple of cardboard boxes.